            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "Hepatic cystic hamartoma also named Mesenchyma hamartoma of liver is a rare benign liver tumor of childhood usually before the age of 2 of mesenchymal origin and variable clinical presentation (abdominal dissension abdominal mass pain vomiting and signs of inferior vena cava compression)."
